  "change_id": "2026-09-17-complete-model-test-coverage",
  "changes": [
    "Completed Markdown model and parent-interaction coverage and shared outcome/violation/observation test selection and maintenance method; native discovery remains execution authority.",
    "Aligned valid controls, independent expected state, failure diagnostics, prohibited effects and recovery across Skill, CLI, Validation, Packaging and Release; all 1,313 original native identities remain.",
    "Added safe generated duration/reporting support to existing CI modes and prepared callers, with final 1,362 native tests + 6 checks, complete case costs/rerun commands and comparable-basis limits.",
    "Corrected report collision preservation, closed workflow stages, release generated-region admission and versioned producer/consumer hashing; new explicit v2 UTF-8 ordering coexists with retained v1 verification."
  ],
