  "limitations": [
    "Hosted CI is unobserved before PR submission; local success is not a hosted result. No merge, release or publication authority is granted.",
    "Semantic fixture assessments do not claim target-agent execution; release provider fixtures do not claim live registry or hosted behavior. Conditional actual-release/exception/incident duties remain with future event owners.",
    "Runtime values are single parallel-load observations; added cases and stronger assertions prevent a speedup claim. Worker duration is not CPU time or wall time; absent paired baseline duration is not zero.",
    "Existing tracked-support migration debt remains open outside this initiative. One early Skill catalog correction predates the user catalog freeze; later implementation uses Markdown design and generated execution reports without catalog refinement."
  ],
  "outcome": "success",
  "rationale": [
    "Current Proposal and complete Design/Delivery packages independently approve the selected direction, exact behavior and allocation; the current Design review binds 104 members and the revised plan governs the bounded v2 correction.",
    "All eight milestones and required corrections are complete. Fresh nonauthor code-review-final assesses the whole delivered diff and interactions; all 16 findings and four blockers have owning dispositions. Milestone approvals are not substituted for the final review.",
    "Complete current source execution passed 1,362 native tests + 6 checks. All 1,142 measured source identities remain exact; all M1 native IDs and M2 full-baseline rows retained. Actual archives, npm pack/install and release candidate composition supply current generated-boundary proof.",
    "Earlier independent semantic assessments retain their scoped exact inputs and limits; current integrated proof covers later executable changes. Failed original reproductions and superseded approvals retain historical subjects, not retargeted meanings.",
    "Local metadata validation passed after review/workflow updates; authoritative record and whitespace checks passed. Final impact and reuse reasoning are bound in final-verification-proof.md. No required proof gap or current concern remains within this delivery scope."
  ],
